// Template. Copy to klap_secret.h and paste in the output of authhash.bat.
//
// klap_secret.h is gitignored on purpose: the value below is
// sha256(sha1(email) + sha1(password)), and with the account email known a
// short password can be recovered from it by brute force. It does not belong
// in a public repository.

